WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:04.110
COLT MCANLIS: The future
of Cloud is now at Next.

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.300
RETO MEIER: But not everyone
can be there in person

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.550
to get new ideas, learn
from industry experts,

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.810
and engage with their peers.

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:10.680
COLT MCANLIS: I'm Colt McAnlis.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:11.450
RETO MEIER: And I'm Reto Meier.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.033
COLT MCANLIS: And
together we'll watch

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:16.590
every one of over 200 sessions
on Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:19.020
RETO MEIER: 200 sessions?

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.520
COLT MCANLIS: Yes,
over 200 sessions

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.730
on Google Cloud Platform,
G Suites, Maps, devices,

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:24.312
and more.

00:00:24.312 --> 00:00:25.020
RETO MEIER: Wait.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.260
And more?

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.056
That's like--

00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:30.460
COLT MCANLIS: 8.3.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:32.229
RETO MEIER: That's
more than eight days

00:00:32.229 --> 00:00:34.500
of continuous sessions.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.420
COLT MCANLIS: Yes, which is
why we will watch them all

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:40.150
and create bite-sized videos
highlighting some of the most

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:42.350
amazing content just for you.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.380
RETO MEIER: Have we
really thought about this?

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.049
COLT MCANLIS: So join me--

00:00:46.049 --> 00:00:46.840
RETO MEIER: And me?

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:49.570
COLT MCANLIS: As we take you on
an exclusive tasting of Google

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:52.900
Cloud Next, distilling
200 hours of Cloud content

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.248
into exquisite concentrate.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.290
If you've liked this
Next recap, check out

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:10.590
the other videos in the
playlist, which should be here?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:12.740
Here?

00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:13.386
Here?

00:01:13.386 --> 00:01:14.230
Down more?

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:14.730
Right there?

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.230
OK.

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:18.010
Click there.

